  "title": "Shrimp and Mushroom Angel Hair Pasta",
  "description": "This dish is highlighted by shrimp and mushrooms sauteed in port wine and a creamy garlic sauce over angel hair pasta. Delicious! Enjoy with your favorite wine, tossed green salad, and garlic bread, if desired.",
  "authors": [
    "Lesly"
